            "heading": "RULES & REGULATIONS",
            "text": "<p>As with all good things, rules and restrictions apply. All gift cards will begin fulfilling on December 4th. All promo codes will be inactive beginning Tuesday, 11\/5\/24, at 12:01AM PST and will be reactivated Tuesday, 12\/3\/2024 at 11:59 PM PST. Discounts or promotions may not be combined with any Black Friday offerings. All products, excluding Second Chance footwear, come with standard manufacturer warranties. Standard return, exchange, and 30 day trials apply, unless otherwise noted. Second Chance models and Customized items are FINAL SALE and therefore return, exchange, warranty and 30 trial policies do not apply. Free Shipping applies to all orders totaling $150+. Original shipping fees are not refundable. If a Black Friday promotional digital gift card is earned with purchase and the original purchase is partially or fully returned, the gift card (a) if unused, will be disabled or (b) if used, the gift card value will be withheld from refund issued as the purchase no longer meets the free gift card threshold. Black Friday\/Cyber Monday Deals are not retroactive and will not apply to any purchases made prior to the sale. Please contact TRUE Customer Care with any questions or concerns during business hours via <a href=\"mailto:help@truelinkswear.com\" target=\"_blank\">help@truelinkswear.com <\/a>or chat on<a href=\"http:\/\/truelinkswear.com\/\" target=\"_blank\"> truelinkswear.com<\/a>. TRUE linkswear reserves the right to adjust, change, or alter any of the Black Friday promotions at any time. The TRUE Black Friday pricing guarantee is made on a best-effort basis. If an order is eligible for a free TRUE Gift Card, that order cannot also be paid for with a TRUE Gift Card. If an order is paid for with a TRUE gift card it is no longer eligible for the free TRUE Gift Card portion of the Black Friday 2024 sale, however may be applied to the total amount of the order.<\/p>",
